WEBVTT

00:17:29.850 --> 00:17:33.679
to, "I'm there to facilitate an experience

00:17:33.703 --> 00:17:36.917
in which people are
open to learning, engage,

00:17:36.941 --> 00:17:39.862
having fun and participating."

00:17:39.886 --> 00:17:45.326
And that was the result of trying
these very unnatural tactics.

00:17:45.350 --> 00:17:48.488
And I learned much more from it

00:17:48.512 --> 00:17:53.666
than doing anything that vaguely
approximated my sense of my authentic self

00:17:53.690 --> 00:17:55.206
at that point in time.

00:17:55.230 --> 00:17:56.470
AG: She started to excel

00:17:56.494 --> 00:17:58.986
when she developed a style
that worked for her.

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:00.499
HI: So it's always a balance